	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You have studied extensively the ruins and secrets left behind by the dead, allowing you to face such creatures with a higher degree of preparation:</p><ul><li><p>You gain an expertise die on any checks made to identify what type of undead a given creature is.</p></li><li><p>If undead creatures are within a 60ft area of you, you cannot be surprised by them.</p></li><li><p>You have procured a holy symbol from a person of faith, and are able to @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.zhuf06durl8bnmh3]{Turn Undead} with it once per day. The Save DC is based on your Wisdom (8+Modifier+Proficiency.)</p></li></ul>",
